! Proposed Definitions And Examples


!! Proposed Definition of ''ri'a''

;__ri'a__ (BAI):  With cause... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is caused by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: rinka, ni'i, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords: With cause

!! Examples of ''ri'a'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i le bolci cu farlu ri'a lo nu mi co'u sarji ri''
''The ball fell because I stopped holding it up.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ri'a ma   ''

;__ri'a ma__ (BAI*):  With what cause? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of rinka and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks what physically caused the event described by the bridi.  See also: rinka, ni'i, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords: With what cause?

!! Examples of ''ri'a ma'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i ri'a ma le tsani cu blanu''
''Why is the sky blue?''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ri'anai''

;__ri'anai__ (BAI*):  Not caused by... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of rinka. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of na'e rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is not caused by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: rinka, ni'i, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords: Not caused by

!! Examples of ''ri'anai'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i mi nelci do ri'anai lo za'i do melbi''
''I like you, but not because you're beautiful.''

!! Note

It should be noted (and this applies to all BAI+nai) constructs that while the above example asserts that "mi nelci do", and it asserts that this isn't a result of "do melbi", it does *not* assert "do melbi" one way or the other.

!! Proposed Definition of ''seri'a''

;__seri'a__ (BAI*):  With result... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is the cause of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: rinka, mu'i, ni'i, ki'u 

** Keywords: With result

!! Examples of ''seri'a'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i do darxi mi seri'a lo za'i mi cortu''
''You hit me, which results in my pain.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''seri'anai''

;__seri'anai__ (BAI*):  Not resulting in... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of rinka. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of na'e rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi does not cause the event described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: rinka, mu'i, ni'i, ki'u

** Keywords: Not resulting in

!! Examples of ''seri'anai'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i do darxi le ve tivni seri'anai lonu ri se cikre''
''You hit the TV, but that doesn't result in it being repaired.''


!! Proposed Definition of ''teri'a''

;__teri'a__ (BAI*):  Caused under conditions... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of rinka.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of rinka and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is caused under the conditions described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: rinka, mu'i, ni'i, ki'u 

** Keywords: Caused under conditions...

!! Examples of ''teri'a'' Usage

Artificial:
'''.i le karce cu xe klama teri'a loza'i mi bilga lonu klama le zarci'''
'''When I have to go to the store, the car is a vehicle.''' 

!! Proposed Definition of ''ni'i''

;__ni'i__ (BAI):  By logic... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of nibli.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi follows logically from the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: nibli, mu'i, ri'a, ki'u 

** Keywords: By logic...

!! Examples of ''ni'i'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i la platos mrobi'o ni'i le du'u py remna''
''Plato dies, which follows logically because he is human.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ni'i ma''

;__ni'i ma__ (BAI*):  By what logic? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of nibli.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of nibli and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks by what logic the event described by the bridi occurs.  See also: nibli, ri'a, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords: By what logic?

!! Examples of ''ni'i ma'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i ni'i ma do krici''
''By what logic do you believe (that)?''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ni'inai''

;__ni'inai__ (BAI*):  Does not logically follow from... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of nibli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi does not logically follow from the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: nibli, ri'a, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords:

!! Examples of ''ni'inai'' Usage

Artificial:

''.i do bilga lonu pilno lo palku kei ni'inai loza'i do nanmu''
''Your being obliged to wear pants doesn't logically follow from the stat of your being a man.''

!! Proposed Definition of ''seni'i''

;__seni'i__ (BAI*):  Logically therefore... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of nibli.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi logically leads to the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: nibli, mu'i, ri'a, ki'u 

** Keywords: Logically therefore...

!! Examples of ''seni'i'' Usage

'''.i seni'i ri cusku no da poi lojbo'''
'''Because of that, nothing lojbanic is expressed.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''seni'inai''

;__seni'inai__ (BAI*):  Does not logically entail... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of nibli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi does not logically entail the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: nibli, ri'a, mu'i, ki'u

** Keywords: Does not logically entail...

!! Examples of ''seni'inai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''teni'i''

;__teni'i__ (BAI*):  Under logic system... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of nibli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of nibli and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi occurs under the logic system described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: nibli, mu'i, ri'a, ki'u 

** Keywords: Under logic system...

!! Examples of ''teni'i'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''mu'i''

;__mu'i__ (BAI):  Because of motive... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi occurs because of the motive described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: mukti, ni'i, ri'a, ki'u 

** Keywords: Because of motive...

!! Examples of ''mu'i'' Usage

'''.i mi cliva mu'i le nu samru'e kelci gi'e sipna do'e le mi se prami'''
'''I leave motivated by computer gaming and sleeping with my beloved.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''mu'i ma''

;__mu'i ma__ (BAI*): With what motive? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of mukti.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of mukti and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks with what motive the event described by the bridi occurs.  See also: mukti, ri'a, ni'i, ki'u

** Keywords: With what motive?

!! Examples of ''mu'i ma'' Usage

'''.i do preti mu'i ma'''
'''Why do you ask?'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''mu'inai''

;__mu'inai__ (BAI*):  Not motivated by... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi  is not motivated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: mukti, ri'a, ni'i, ki'u

** Keywords: Not motivated by...

!! Examples of ''mu'inai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''semu'i''

;__semu'i__ (BAI*):  Motive therefore... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is the motive behind the event described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: mukti, ni'i, ri'a, ki'u 

** Keywords: Motive therefore...

!! Examples of ''semu'i'' Usage

'''.i mi mutce xagji semu'i le nu mi pu'o citka''' (Modified from original.)
'''I'm very hungry, which motivates that I am about to eat.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''semu'inai''

;__semu'inai__ (BAI*):  Not motivated by... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is not the motive for the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: mukti, ri'a, ni'i, ki'u

** Keywords: Not motivated by...

!! Examples of ''semu'inai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''temu'i''

;__temu'i__ (BAI*):  Motive of person... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of mukti. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of mukti and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is related tomotive behind the event described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: mukti, ni'i, ri'a, ki'u 

** Keywords: Motive of person...

!! Examples of ''temu'i'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''ki'u''

;__ki'u__ (BAI):  Because of reason... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi  occurs for the reason indicated by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: krinu, ni'i, ri'a, mu'i

** Keywords: Because of reason...

!! Examples of ''ki'u'' Usage

'''.i mi nelci la lojban ki'u lenu mi pensi ta'i le pe'a lojbo'''
'''I like lojban because I think in a figuratively lojbanic manner.'''


!! Proposed Definition of ''ki'u ma''

;__ki'u ma__ (BAI*):  With what reason? Tags a sumti question marker as fitting the first place of krinu.  Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the first place of krinu and then fills it with a sumti question cmavo (ma).  In other words, the tagged sumti asks with what reason the event described by the bridi occurs.  See also: krinu, ri'a, mu'i, ni'i

** Keywords: With what reason?

!! Examples of ''ki'u ma'' Usage

'''.i ki'u ma do cusku zo co'o'''
'''Why do you say goodbye?'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ki'unai''

;__ki'unai__ (BAI*): Without reason... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is not reasonably justified by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: krinu, ri'a, ni'i, ni'i 

** Keywords: Without reason...

!! Examples of ''ki'unai'' Usage

'''.i mi na zukte fi loza'i se ckasu lo selgubni .e lo malsi .e lo ternuzba kei .e lenu bai mupli le barda tcica kei ki'unai loza'i mi cusku le sampu jetnu poi le saske cu ba je'urbai'''
'''I do not purpose being pilloried by the public, the pulpit, and the press, and held up as a colossal liar when I am but telling the simple truths which some day science will substantiate.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''seki'u''

;__seki'u__ (BAI*):  Reasonably therefore... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is the reason behind the event described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: krinu, ni'i, ri'a, mu'i

** Keywords: Reasonably therefore...

!! Examples of ''seki'u'' Usage

'''.i mi ca gunka penmi seki'u le nu masno spuda''' (Slightly modified.)
'''I am at a work meeting, which is the reason for my slow replies.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''seki'unai''

;__seki'unai__ (BAI*):  Not motivated by... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of krinu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of krinu and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is not the reason for the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: krinu, ri'a, ni'i, mu'i

** Keywords: Not motivated by...

!! Examples of ''seki'unai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''bai''

;__bai__ (BAI):  Compelled by... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of bapli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of bapli and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is compelled by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: bapli

** Keywords: Compelled by

!! Examples of ''bai'' Usage

'''.i za'a bai lo skami mi nalviska le se cinri nu casnu''' (Rather modified.)
'''Apparently, the computer compels me to not see the interesting discussion.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''sebai''

;__sebai__ (BAI*):  Forcing result... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of bapli. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of bapli and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi compels the result described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: bapli

** Keywords: Forcing result

!! Examples of ''sebai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''fau''

;__fau__ (BAI):  In the event of... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of fasnu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of fasnu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is associated with an event described by referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: fasnu

** Keywords: In the event of...

!! Examples of ''fau'' Usage

Artificial:

