''With the event of standing up, I express that the eating is over.''

!! Proposed definition of ''sau''

;__sau__ (BAI):  Requiring... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of sarcu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of sarcu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi requires the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: sarcu

** Keywords: Requiring...

!! Examples of ''sau'' Usage

Artificial:

'''.i do nenri sau tu'a le ckiku vorme'''
'''You enter, with requirement the key word.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''sesau''

;__sesau__ (BAI*):  Required for... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of sarcu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of sarcu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is required for the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: sarcu

** Keywords: Required for...

!! Examples of ''sesau'' Usage

'''.i pe'u ko sanli vi le serti se sau le nu mi do badgau''' (Slightly modified.)
'''Please stand at the stares, which is required for my defending you.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''tesau''

;__tesau__ (BAI*):  Required under conditions... Tags a sumti as fitting the 3rd place of sarcu. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 3rd place of sarcu and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is required under the conditions described by the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: sarcu

** Keywords: Required under conditions...

!! Examples of ''tesau'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''ja'e''

;__ja'e__ (BAI):  Therefore result... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of jalge. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of jalge and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi results from the tagged sumti.  See also: jalge

** Keywords: Therefore result...

!! Examples of ''ja'e'' Usage

'''.i le li'i clupa nu casnu bau roda ja'e node cu rinka''' (Slightly modified.)
'''The experience of a looping discussion in all languages which results in nothing is the cause.'''

!! Proposed Definition of ''ja'enai''

;__ja'enai__ (BAI*): Without result... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 1st place of jalge. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of jalge and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi does not result in the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jalge

** Keywords: Without result...

!! Examples of ''ja'enai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''seja'e''

;__seja'e__ (BAI*): Results because ... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of jalge. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of jalge and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi results because of the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jalge

** Keywords: Results because...

!! Examples of ''seja'e'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''seja'enai''

;__seja'enai__ (BAI*): Results not because ... Tags a sumti as not fitting the 2nd place of jalge. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of jalge and then fills it with the tagged sumti.  In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is not the reason for the referent of the tagged sumti.  See also: jalge,

** Keywords: Results not because

!! Examples of ''seja'enai'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''seva'o''

;__seva'o__ (BAI*): As conditions for ... Tags a sumti as fitting the 2nd place of vanbi. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 2nd place of vanbi and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi is the condition under which the referent of the tagged sumti occurs.  See also: vanbi

** Keywords: As conditions for...

!! Examples of ''seva'o'' Usage

!! Proposed Definition of ''va'o''

;__va'o__ (BAI):  Under conditions... Tags a sumti as fitting the 1st place of vanbi. Augments the bridi in which it occurs, adding an extra place with the meaning of the 1st place of vanbi and then fills it with the tagged sumti. In other words, the tagged sumti indicates that the event described by the bridi occurs under the conditions described by the tagged sumti.  See also: vanbi

** Keywords: Under conditions...

!! Examples of ''va'o'' Usage

'''.i va'o le nu rodo na kakne le nu damba bau lo lojban. kei pe'u ko na damba'''
